sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Streamlit App
    participant Model as ML Engine
    participant TMDB as TMDB API

    User->>App: Launch Application
    App->>Model: load_movies()
    Model-->>App: DataFrame
    App->>Model: build_movie_vectors()
    Model-->>App: Sparse Matrix (CSR)

    User->>App: Enters Movie Title ("Matrix")
    App->>App: resolve_title("Matrix")
    App-->>App: "The Matrix"

    App->>Model: get_recommendations("The Matrix")
    Model->>Model: Calculate Cosine Similarity
    Model-->>App: Top 10 Recommendations

    loop For each recommendation
        alt TMDB API Key Provided
            App->>TMDB: fetch_poster(title)
            TMDB-->>App: Poster URL
            App->>User: Render Poster + Title
        else No API Key
            App->>User: Render Local Fallback Card
        end
    end
